window.products.push({"id":1012010,"name":"Imrsanl Cremation Jewelry for Ashes Tree of Life Urn Necklace Cylinder Vial Urn Necklace for Men Women Keepsake Ashes Necklace Pendent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zn66+ARAL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Imrsanl Cremation Jewelry  This cremation urn necklace is made of high quality stainless steel that will never tarnish or fade. This necklace is a beautiful way to remember your loved one and keep them close to your heart every day. The top of this cremation pendant unscrews and may be used to hold a small amount of ashes, hair, sand, fur or whatever you'd like to remember your beloved pet, family member or friend.   Material - 316L Stainless Steel 316L Stainless Steel is durable and won't tarnish or rust Secure Threaded Screw Top with Air Tight Gasket Keeps Contents Secure Even with Daily Wear Capacity: Small pinch of ashes, pet ashes, hair, perfume, dirt, sand, etc.   * INCLUDED * Stainless Steel chain (20”+1.5”extension chain ) Filling Kit (Funnel, Pin & Instructions) Blue Gift Box   Can be used as: * ash necklace - cremation jewelry for ashes - urn for ashes - urn necklace for ashes - urn pendant for ashes - ash pendants cremation jewelry  - cremation pendants for ashes - pendant for ashes - ash lockets - cremation jewelry - memorial necklace for ashes - chain for ashes - ashes keepsake - jewelry for ashes - cremation ashes- cremation jewelry - pet urn  EASY TO USE  Twist the screw  Ready: ashes, hair, urn ashes, allowing you to store what is valuable for you.  Pour the ashes into the funnel,stainless steel pin can help guide the remains into the pendant.  Place a very small drop of super glue on the threads before sealing.  It is the perfect memorial piece to keep your loved ones close to your heart!   Meaningful memorial jewelry  It’s a gift suitable for a first choice for such events as birthday, anniversary, Christmas Day, Graduation, Mother’s Day, Valentine’s Day and so forth. Presented to different people, it expresses different types of love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zn66+ARAL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Imrsanl","source_asin":"B0BQR873VT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQR873VT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQR873VT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1012011,"name":"Bra Wash Bags for Lingerie Delicates, High Permeability Sandwich Fabric Mesh Laundry Bag for Bras Underwear Socks Panties Stockings, Zippered Protecto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v6SmOS8-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SWEET TOWN Committed to superior household necessities, Sweet Town is a fashion brand upholding the concept of ecological & environmental protection. With the principle of “ Quality First, Credit First, Customers First ”, we always offer our customers the best quality, most competitive price and excellent services. We are trying our best to provide 100% customer satisfaction, if you have any question, please feel free to contact us. We will spare no effort to provide solutions right off the bat. FEATURES Are you tired of washing by hands? Are you tired of packing up clothes after washing? Are you sick of looking for little pieces? Are you sick of your clothes tearing, tangling or deformed in washer? Say Goodbye to Entanglement, Deformation, Wear and Tear It’s time to use Sweet Town Laundry Bags! Made of selected fabrics with thick sandwiches, our laundry bags separate delicates such as bras, lingerie, underwear and socks for cleaner washing, which are designed to protect your small clothing from pilling, tangling and tearing while machine washing, making the wash easier and more efficient. Travel Organizer Great for organizing your bras, lingerie, underwear and small pieces when packing for a trip, keep your trunk tidy. SPECIFICATIONS Mesh Laundry Bag Contents: Pack of 4 3Pcs Cylinder Laundry Bags: 6.3H×6.3D inch (16×16 cm) 1Pcs Triangle Laundry Bag: 5.9H×7.1D inch (15×18 cm) WASHING TIPS 1 Please DO REMEMBER to slide the zipper pull inside the flap to keep it from unzipping and ensure a quiet and safe wash. 2 Please DO NOT put too much clothing into mesh laundry bags, 2/3 of the standard capacity would be appropriate for a clean wash. Overloading will affect the washing effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v6SmOS8-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweet Town","source_asin":"B07SS6HTK1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SS6HTK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SS6HTK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
