window.products.push({"id":1012136,"name":"HONYIN Small Clip on Fan, 6” CVT USB Desk Fan, Strong Airflow, Quiet Table Cooling Fan, Portable Personal Fan with Sturdy Clamp for Bed Office Treadmi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713gCzDObSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OPTIMUM COOLING PERFORMANCE: This small clip fan head adopts aircraft engine design and aerodynamic turbine design for better control of airflow and superb precision in delivery to maximize airflow for more effective cooling. Feel the power of a small fan up to 10 feet away to cool you off. Now is the time to invest in a decent little but powerful fan that will keep you cool all summer long. Extremely Cool & Practical Super Car Clamp: Easily clip on any surface, even running upside down, and also can be adjusted to cool in every direction. Whether you are using it at your home, office, school, RV, or dorm, which ensures that airflow is being directed to the desired location & doesn't slip or fall, and the grip clamp with soft rubber can clip on a surface up to 2.8 inches in thickness without leaving any trace. Infinitely Variable Speed & Low decibel: Precisely control your airflow, unlike the traditional fixed-speed adjustment button, the USB desk & clip fan adjusts the wind speed through a 180-degree adjustable knob, you can easily customize your airflow and cooling needs by CVT. The quiet fan for the bedroom runs as low as 20 dB, providing whisper-quiet cooling for a comfortable sleep. High Compatibility USB Powered: Powered by a 3.9ft USB cable, and compatible with PC/laptop, power bank, AC adapter, car charger, and other USB-enabled power supplies.This usb clip fan will keep working as long as the power is connected. (Note: This is USB powered fan, with No battery, No wall charger included) Tilt-Adjustable Head & Detachable Front Grill: The personal mini fan used humanized adjustable head design, rotates horizontally from 0°to 360°, and rotates up and down 45°to direct the airflow to the place you want. Keep performing for years to come by cleaning dust off the front grille, air inlets, and blade, with access provided by a removable grill.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713gCzDObSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HONYIN","source_asin":"B09TR2FYBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TR2FYBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TR2FYBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
