window.products.push({"id":1012144,"name":"Marketing Holders Acrylic Locking Vertical Cabinet with Keys 8\" x 8\" x 16\" Clear Countertop Hinged Swing Door Locker for Retail Products and Convenien","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MXXnyxoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vertical Acrylic Locking Display Case with 3 Shelves. One Piece, No Assembly Required. Overall Dimensions: 8.75\"W x 8.5\"D x 16.5\"H. Inner Dimensions: 8\"W x 8\"D x 16\"H. Top Shelf: 4\"H. All Other Shelves: 375\"H. Thickness: 0.118\", 3MM, 1/8\". *All sizes are approximate Features a hinged swing door with a cam lock for keeping your items safe and clean! Each cabinet comes with two keys for securing contents. Contains three shelves that form four compartments for retail products! This lucite retail cupboard has non skid rubber bumpers to protect your table or counter. Made from premium acrylic Display Case Cabinets are excellent choices for gift shops, galleries, and museums. These are also used in Bakeries for Bread and Pastries. Give customers a great view of your merchandise without sacrificing product hygiene & cleanliness with this fantastic Acrylic Display. This sturdy and attractive counter top display cabinet will complement any bakery, cafe, convenience store, kiosk, bar counter or market stall. Let your customers get a great view of your product with this lockable lucite case. Acrylic products are also sturdy, durable, and easy to clean. Perfect addition to any retail shop, gas station or convenient store countertop. This plexiglass case keeps special products out of children's hands and dust free. This free-standing display cabinet features premium acrylic construction that allows customers to view merchandise without having access to them. Thanks to their fixed multi-level shelving, these cases can hold a lot more items than just placing product on the counter. This locking showcase display is a good choice for flea market, antique stores, and other businesses that sell a lot of smaller products like perfumes, lotions, make up, jewelry, watches and more. *All sizes are approximate *Tolerances: Thickness +/- 10%","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MXXnyxoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marketing Holders","source_asin":"B07YX3J64C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YX3J64C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YX3J64C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
