window.products.push({"id":1012322,"name":"Room Divider Folding Privacy Scrrens with Wheels, 102'' Wide Wall Divider for Room Separation, 3 Panel Movable Room Privacy Panel with Non-See Through","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PP28Z+N6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UPGRADED FABRIC & REINFORCED STRUCTURE: Homscreener Room Dividers and Folding Privacy Screens are made of thickened opaque fabric and premium steel frame. The room divider fabric is coating with PA ,which is waterproof and will not wrinkle, and the steel frame is sprayed with a frosted coating to resist rust and scratches. Our upgraded room divider is stronger and stands up straighter, lasting long time service-time. FREESTANDING & EASY TO MOVE: Our Room Dividers equipped with 15.75 inch/40 cm steel casters and 8pcs PE universal wheels, which allow you to move it anywhere very easily. We also added 4 brakes for each leg to improve the stability of the Privacy Screen and prevent it from slipping. The 3 Panel Wall Divider Size: 102''W X 72.2''H, Each Panel Size: 34''Wx72.2''H CREATE MORE ADDITION PRIVACY SPACE: If you work or study in a public place, our Room Divider Screen will help you to create a extra personal space and let you focus on your task. it's also can be worked as a partition for separating your living room from kitchen or block out other cluttered views. Just take it back and enjoy your time. FLEXIBLE & SAVING SPACE: This Partition Room Divider is connected by plastic hinged buckles, which means you can freely combine it into any direction according to your different needs. It's also can be used as 3 single elements or connected as a multiple partition. The foldable design allows you to save space and store easily when not in use. SUPPORT & GUARANTEE: The package includes all the accessories and manual, you can also follow the assembly video to complete the installation within 30 minutes. If any parts are lost or damaged in transit, please contact us in time for replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PP28Z+N6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMSCREENER","source_asin":"B0BDRDPPFN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDRDPPFN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDRDPPFN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
