window.products.push({"id":1012435,"name":"Le Creuset Medium Spatula, Cherry Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31hzqXaSC3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Toss out those warped and stained utensils. This fine grade silicone spatula keeps its shape and color use after use. The medium spatula resists stains and does not absorb food flavors or stains. Heat resistant to 480 F, this helpful tool keeps its cool its pans on the burner. Perfectly suited for the thickest of batters, this medium spatula is angled to scrape flat and curved surfaces effortlessly. The spatula will not scratch surfaces and is ideal for nonstick and metal cookware. Spatula head detaches for easy cleaning by hand in soapy water or in the dishwasher. Amazon.com Get every last lick of batter out of the bowl and into the pan with Le Creuset's standard-size flexible spatula. Made from a silicon that resists temperatures of up to 800 degrees F, this spatula is designed to bend and mold to your bowls so every nook and cranny can be scraped clean. A special stainproof coating keeps this bright-red spatula looking new, and its silicon construction ensures it will never crack or fade--nor will it absorb flavors and odors of foods. An essential tool for any kitchen, Le Creuset's spatula comes in several sizes and six other vivid colors. Remove the wooden handle before placing the head in the dishwasher. --Meg Heffernan","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31hzqXaSC3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B00004S7U9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004S7U9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004S7U9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
