window.products.push({"id":1012444,"name":"FUIKEING 36 x 28 LED Bathroom Mirror with Front and Backlit, Bathroom Wall Mirror with Lights, Anti-Fog, Memory, Dimmable, 3 Colors Temperature, LED V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qDlvYDXcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Stepless Dimmable Light - FUIKEING LED bathroom mirror is bright enough which perfect for selfies and makeup, long press the smart touch button to adjust the brightness you want, and the lighted vanity mirror will remember the last setting to keep same status after turning off. Color temperature can switch warm(3000K)/natural(4500K)/white(6000K) with short touching. Premium Material - The bathroom vanity mirror is made by premium explosion-proof glass which is more sturdy than normal bathroom mirrors, even it is broken, it will not shatter to piece, no harm, more safe to use. IP44 rate to ensure safe although in wet bathroom environment, high-definition imaging without distortion(CRI>90), over 50000 hours lifespan. You will see a beautiful mirror no matter you mount it horizontal or Vertical. Anti-fog - Short press the \"Anti-fog Button\" of the led vanity mirror, the heating pad on the back will keep the lighted mirror fog free. We set this function to automatically turn off after one hour to avoid overheating and you don't have to worry about safety hazards. Smart LED Mirror - You will receive a beautiful smart bathroom mirror with lights, silicone bumper corners, our mirror is easy to control and the sensitivity of the touch buttons will not be affected in the wet space of the bathroom, it will make you enjoy the time of makeup, grooming or shaving. Easy to Install - Following the instructions, the bathrroom mirror for wall is simple to install, it will take you about 10-15 minites if you want to power it with a plug or hard-wire. If you want hard-wire it to a wall switch to control the led mirror, it is best assemble it by a professional electrician. When you have the led mirror for bathroom, better appreciate your beauty!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qDlvYDXcL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUIKEING","source_asin":"B0BPPWCZ4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPPWCZ4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPPWCZ4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
