window.products.push({"id":1012478,"name":"Mythrojan in The Name of The King Viking Drinking Horn with Leather Holder – Polished Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qq8faZjGL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Imported Hand Wash Only ⭐ GENEROUS SIZE ♦♦ 350ml is the perfect size, making it easy to carry during events while offering enough volume to delight even the thirstiest Viking warrior! ⭐ 100% LEAK-FREE & ETHICALLY SOURCED GENUINE HORN ♦♦ Our drinking horns are individually made by hand, highly polished, and sealed to keep the horn beautiful and leak-free for years to come. Each one is unique and the result of patient craftsmanship by skilled horn makers using only 100% natural horn, carefully chosen for its beauty, strength, and sturdiness. As with any natural product, the color and shape will have natural variations. No two are the same. ⭐ 100% GENUINE LEATHER HOLDER ♦♦ With the carefully handcrafted HOLDER OFFERED FOR FREE with your horn, you will never lose it and will always have a place to hold it on your belt next to your trusted axe or deadly sword! ♦♦ Wondering how to pack & transport your lovely horn to your event? We have you covered! ⭐ A NICE PROTECTIVE MYTHROJAN BAG IS ALSO OFFERED FOR FREE! ⭐ IDEAL FOR AMAZING MEDIEVAL EVENTS, SCA, WEDDINGS, COSPLAY, or LARP! Is there anything better than sharing a good beer or a nice hydromel with good friends at a festive banquet or a memorable medieval wedding? ♦♦ Wherever your adventure is set, our beautiful drinking horn will hold up to all your feasts and banquets, from the simple battlefield encampment to the impressive tables of the mead hall of your warlord! ⭐ LIFETIME GUARANTEE: Providing you with high-quality products is what we do, and your FULL SATISFACTION and happiness are of utmost importance to us! All warranty issues are handled directly by Mythrojan. If you receive something that is not up to your expectations, CONTACT US, and we will work with you to resolve the problem. If, over time, a Mythrojan product no longer lives up to your expectations, CONTACT US, and we will work with you to assure SATISFACTION!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qq8faZjGL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mythrojan","source_asin":"B07T7L9W5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T7L9W5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T7L9W5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
