window.products.push({"id":1012521,"name":"Pressure Sensitive Torque Activated Seals Cap Liners - 45 mm (1.77\") -100 PCS -Made in USA- for Glass & Plastic Bottles & Containers - No Induction Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91T0Q1PI9NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These polystyrene jar foam liner seals coated with torque-activated adhesive require no tools and no heat induction equipment. For proper application consider the following recommendations: ● Make sure your pressure sensitive liner size matches the jar opening.  These 45 mm (1.77 inches) seals are to be used with jars or bottles that measure slightly less than 45 mm in outer diameter neck size. ● Completely clean the jar top with clean cloth and alcohol to clear of liquid  and/or solids. Center jar seal on top of you plastic or glass jar, and apply. The white  side of the seal shall be facing down, the side with red letters shall be facing up. ● Screw metal or plastic cap on jar. Make sure the liner and cap are tightly secured on the container. ● Once the cap is applied, it should not be removed for at least 24 hours to ensure proper adhesion. Although depending on your application, the adhesion process might take significantly less time. ● Seals can be used with glass and plastic jars and with lined or unlined caps. These pressure sensitive liners are best for use with powder or dry products . ● Avoid overfilling your containers! ● Once seal is removed, it cannot be reapplied. ● Not suitable for applications containing oil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91T0Q1PI9NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Advanced Girl","source_asin":"B07T9WVLCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T9WVLCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T9WVLCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1012522,"name":"Unscented 100 hr Candle. 21oz Smokeless Burn, Palm Wax, Budget & Eco-Friendly, Re-use Old Containers, No Hassle Creative Gift Set for a Romantic Night","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VnDBQiJ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHATS INCLUDED & HOW TO USE - This candle kit includes 21oz unscented palm wax powder and 20 wicks that last for 8 hours each, 100-hour candlelight, ready to use. Just turn off the cap, pour the powder into any fireproof container, stick in the wick and light it up, no hassle, it’s that easy. SMOKELESS CLEAN BURN - Our powder candle kit is made of natural eco-friendly palm wax. This wax burns without emitting toxins into our breathable air. The wicks are made of natural cotton which burns without smoke, completely odorless. GET CREATIVE & CREATE PERFECT AMBIANCE – This budget friendly kit enables you to create a romantic & cozy ambiance while also allowing you to be creative by using any type of fireproof containers (seashells, pumpkins, re-fill old candle jars, bowls, glassware etc.) that you own. It’s also a great emergency kit in case the power goes out. UNSCENTED & ECO-FRIENDLY – Made from environmentally friendly and sustainable materials such as cotton and palm wax. Unscented & odorless burn is unharmful and provides a comfortable and natural candlelight ambiance without nasty smells. A WONDERFUL GIFT – An awesome gift idea for special occasions such as Christmas and Birthdays you can be sure that the powder candle will bring a smile to the faces of your loved ones because it can be used to create a candle exactly to one’s liking, a perfect gift set for to match any decor, event or gathering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VnDBQiJ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Powder Candle","source_asin":"B095SRM1PG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095SRM1PG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095SRM1PG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
