window.products.push({"id":1012748,"name":"Small Oval Whale Dish, Soap Dish, Plate, Spoon Rest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8150Rw1NLlL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This little whale dish is perfect for the nautical and beach lover. It is handmade out of white speckled earthenware clay. While the clay was still wet, I imprinted the whale design which I made from a stamper I carved out of clay. The intricacy of the whale design is highlighted with gray glazes. The border is glazed in teal. Fired twice in my kiln for durability, and painted using non-toxic, lead free ceramic glazes. Measures approximately 4 3/4 by 3 1/4 inches. One of a kind, and entirely handmade by me in my studio in South Carolina, USA. Food and dishwasher safe. Perfect for giving for: -A beach house visit -To a beach lover -As a hostess gift -For a Birthday -Just to show you love someone! Can be used as: -a small serving dish -a dish to eat off of -a soapdish -decoration -ring holder -earring holder -tea bag holder - spoon rest -a tapas dish If you like this design, but prefer different colors, just message me. I am happy to customize! I can make a dish like this personalized with a name or date for an additional $4.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8150Rw1NLlL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peach Blossom Studio","source_asin":"B074KVYBFJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074KVYBFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074KVYBFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
