window.products.push({"id":1012794,"name":"SYJAN HOME Ceramic Coffee Mug - 11oz Standard Size Stoneware Mug with Handle,Handmade Suitable for Americano, Latte, Cappuccinos, Tea, Hot Chocolate, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O3NGqLs0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A little thing, a exquisite daily life Wake up with a cup of coffee or tea? A beautiful cup will make this daily work better. Our stoneware coffee cup achieves a balance of retro-looking appearance between humanized design and durability, and it must be pleasant over time. All of our ceramics come from Dehua, which enjoys the reputation of one of the Three Porcelain Capitals in China. Ceramic manufacturing has a history of thousands of years. Relaxed and comfortable The handle is strong enough. But not too thick to be difficult to hold. It has an ergonomic shape, so you can carry it with you without worrying about spilling hot drinks. There is enough space between the handle and the cup, and you can pass through it with three fingers. These problems make the cup easy to pick up. Handmade Mug is Unique but not Flawless The colors and patterns of each unique cup are different because these cups are handmade and hand-glazed. They may have small black spots, pinholes or scratches on their surface. This is a common situation and will not affect the overall appearance and use. Enjoy Your Coffee in Style This ceramic cup has an elegant but simple embossed Roman column design, which will surely look charming in your home. The size is moderate, very suitable for people who slowly taste tea! Perfect as a gift idea, or if you want to enjoy your precious coffee time! How to Take Care of Your Mugs? In order to keep the stoneware in its best condition, wash it as soon as possible after drinking to prevent soiling, especially tea and coffee. Hand washing is the gentlest method, just wet the inside of the cup with cold water, and then scrub the cup with a sponge or detergent. You can also put cups in the dishwasher. The ceramic tea cup is fragile, please use it with care. To avoid injury, it should be stored in the house out of reach of children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O3NGqLs0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SYJAN HOME","source_asin":"B094GV4R8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094GV4R8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094GV4R8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1012795,"name":"All Clad Ovenware 9-inch x 13-inch Shallow Baker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PBqA5UahL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The All Clad 9 inch x 13 inch Jelly Jr./Oblong Baker is ideal for baking desserts, bars, rolls or even potatoes. All Clad Ovenware is designed to same exacting standards that give All Clad Cookware its legendary performance and heirloom durability. All Clad Ovenware is also bonded using tri-ply construction; 18/10 stainless steel on the exterior/interior with a pure aluminum core. The stainless steel will not react with food and is easy to clean, and in addition the aluminum core offers supreme heat distribution. All Clad Ovenware is made to withstand extreme heat-with the added bonus of being dishwasher safe. For roasting, baking, and service at the table, the versatility of All Clad cookware is limited only by the boundries of your imagination. All Clad Ovenware is made in the U.S.A.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PBqA5UahL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B0024JZWJ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0024JZWJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0024JZWJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
