window.products.push({"id":1012806,"name":"Prepara 2inch, Set of 4 Ice Ball Molds, 2 inch, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617apvPXblL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make large balls of ice with Prepara Ice Ball Mold ! The Prepara Ice Ball Mold is ideal for making 2-inch ice balls . The transparent mold produces spherical frozen water that fits perfectly in most glasses. Its large size ensures that it melts slower than the standard-sized ice cube , which means it dilutes your drink less- great for those whiskey lovers amongst us. The ice orbs produced by the mold are also ideal for drinks in pitchers, punch bowls, and tumblers, as they keep large volumes of liquid cold for prolonged periods of time. Each set contains 4 ice ball molds. They can be used to freeze 4 ice balls simultaneously, giving you more ice balls at once. These molds are ideal for parties, picnics, dates, social gatherings, gourmet celebrations, and fancy novelty settings. They have a sturdy silicone cap that is sealed tight to prevent spillage , allowing zero leaks and no overflowing. The mold has four “feet” on its base that help keep the plastic mold upright, so it will never roll over inside the fridge. The design of the cap and base guarantees a mess-free kitchen. The ice balls produced by these handy molds are perfect for delicious fruit drinks, non-alcoholic and alcoholic beverages, and other drink recipes. The ice ball molds have a snap opening around their center that allows you to insert mint leaves, basil, spices, berries, lemon, citrus slices, or even juices inside to create flavored ice. Once chilled, the flavored ice can be added to your drink, complementing your beverage. The Prepara Ice Mold is suitable for home and business use. It is BPA-free , so it’s non-toxic and safe to use. The mold is also dishwasher safe for easy maintenance. It contains small parts not intended to be handled by small children. Cool yourself with a cold beverage and pop an ice ball in your drink with the Prepara Ice Ball Mold .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617apvPXblL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prepara","source_asin":"B00F5NDK6I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F5NDK6I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F5NDK6I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
