window.products.push({"id":1012832,"name":"Mueller Electric Wine Opener Set - Rechargeable Batteries and USB Charging Cable - Electric Corkscrew Opener with Foil Cutter, Wine Pourer, Vacuum Sto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xi4Cx1efL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All-in-One Set - Have you been struggling with opening wine corks for years? Mueller Electric Corkscrew Opener is an essential solution for every true wine enthusiast. With a sleek, modern design it opens bottles in just seconds at a simple push of a button. Includes wine accessories; a Foil Cutter, a Wine Aerator Pourer, and a Vacuum Stopper to slow down oxidation. Everything you need, from easy opening and pouring to preserving your favorite bottle of wine! Rechargeable Batteries – You don't have to worry about buying and replacing batteries as the Mueller Wine Opener Set comes with 4 AA rechargeable batteries. When the battery indicator turns red, simply place the Electric Wine Opener on its base and connect with USB cable. When the battery is fully charged, indicator light will turn off, notifying you the Wine Opener is ready to use. Dual-Operation - Open red, white, rose wine or any other drinks with corks within just a couple of seconds. Holding the Wine Opener at 90-degress will turn the corkscrew to remove the cork from the bottle. After that, rotating the Wine Opener to the side will remove the cork from the corkscrew with just the touch of the button. No more hassle of pulling, twisting, or broken cork pieces. With the Mueller Wine Bottle Opener, the whole process lasts about 6-8 seconds! Unique Present for All Wine Lovers - Makes a perfect wine gift for every occasion such as a birthday, anniversary, wedding, retirement, or house warming present for new home. Also, very handy for restaurants, bars, hotels, or any wine & dine businesses. Superior Quality With Mueller - We are here to offer you only the best quality products designed to make your life easier. If you need any help, please feel free to contact us. Our unparalleled 24/7 live telephone customer support is ready and waiting to assist with anything you need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xi4Cx1efL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mueller Austria","source_asin":"B08RLW2MGX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RLW2MGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RLW2MGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
