window.products.push({"id":1012860,"name":"Personal Air Cooler, 3 in 1 Portable Mini Air Conditioner Fan, Quiet 400ML Evaporative Air Cooler, 3 Speeds, 2/4 Timer, Desktop Humidifier Misting Coo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VYrTfvH5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❅【3 in 1 Design Refresh Whole Summer】Enjoy our personal air cooler, both a humidifier and electric fan, say goodbye to sweat and hotness. One portable air conditioner for multiple functions, ADDING BOTH ICE TUBES AND WATER FOR COOLING in summer, just water for humidifying skin in dry autumn and winter, you can use it all year round. NOTE: IT CAN'T CHILL AN ENTIRE ROOM, JUST FOR PERSONAL SPACE. ❅【3 Speed with Large Water Tank】Breeze, natural, strong winds, adjustable speeds customizes your various needs. A full 400ML tank of the personal air conditioner fan keeps spraying for 6-8 hours (Depend on fan speed), bring you continuous coolness without regular refilling, comfort and ease. NOTE: THE SMALL AIR CONDITIONER FAN IS PLUG IN DESIGN, NOT USB RECHARGE. ❅【Low Noise and 2/4H Auto Timer】Do you want free control using time? Are you tired of getting up in the middle night to turn it off? Our evaporative air cooler, designed with 2H, 4H automatically shut off to prevent a cold, is exactly what you need. Ultra quiet, below 62 dB, never disturb work and rest, the humidifier cooling fan is an excellent companion for summer. ❅【Easy to Carry & Power-Saving】Lightweight (0.8 pound) with handle, easy to bring the portable air cooler fan anywhere. Compact size ( 8.9*5.1* 5.1 Inch), takes no place, suits for room, dorm and office. 18w low-energy consuming results in cheaper electricity bills. Both space efficient and economical mini air conditioner is a must-haves to clear away blistering hot. ❅【7 LED Lights & Risk-Free Purchase】7 color night lights of the desk misting fan serves you with romantic atmosphere, freely change them based on need to get away from bad mood but enjoy soft breeze. 7/24 online service and 12 month replacement allow you to buy the portable ac air conditioner without worries. NOTE: LONG PRESS LIGHT BUTTON TO TURN LIGHT OFF.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VYrTfvH5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Page Hodge","source_asin":"B09SFT63CV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SFT63CV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SFT63CV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
