window.products.push({"id":1012906,"name":"Ambesonne Faux Suede Bench Cushion, Digitally Printed Weathered Texture, Standard Size Foam Pad with Decorative Fabric Cover for Kitchen Bedroom Indoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hsBfyFbIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STANDARD SIZE - 45\" W x 15\" L x 2\" H. Soft and comfy bench cushion for kitchen, patio, home decor.FEATURES - High-quality foam pad inserts. Removable and washable fabric cover with decorative print.MADE FROM - Comfortable high resilience (HR) foam with 100% Polyester, WATERPROOF fabric cover.VERSATILE - Fits the bench in every room in your home. Can be used indoor and outdoor. Very durable.EASY CARE - MACHINE WASHABLE removable cover. Stain resistant. Has zipper for hassle-free cleaning.Ambesonne bench pillow with high resilience foam and a washable removable cover. The foam has no chemical odor and harmful materials in it. You can take the cover out and wash it very easily. Wash on a delicate/cold cycle and iron it on low heat. So long as you follow the care instructions the dye will not fade and you will have a long-lasting decorative and comfortable accent piece. Perfect present for your mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter and all other loved ones. You can save yourself some trouble by opting out one of the thousands of designs for a gift idea. Our products have a great variety of color, hues and patterns so you can surely find something you'll like in no time. The prints are made with up to date presses and utilizing the latest technology we can deliver you only the best goods possible. The products we provide goes great in the kitchen seats, entryway, porch swing, front porch, hall bench and any seating area. So this is a very versatile product. You can use it almost everywhere. Living room, bathroom, and bedroom. You will find nothing but comfy cushions that looks incredible. After receiving the item, we advise you to air it our for a day and let the foam expand. The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible, however, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hsBfyFbIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ambesonne","source_asin":"B08TWJHQ4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1012906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TWJHQ4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TWJHQ4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
